  "description": "This doesn’t mean we have no impact but remember, we are consumers. Working class people have very little power against climate change if we all act seperately. Instead of criticizing people for driving or using a plastic straw, look for ethical/sustainable alternatives to give less money to big corporations. No matter what though, the best way to inact change is through education and policy. That’s where we, OY4C, come in. Time to stop blaming each other and and unite against those causing the majority of the problem! Join us in our youth led fight against climate change! 🫶🏼🌎🌲🌻🌈🪸🌊🪷 #OY4C #climateaction #youthactivism #sustainability #climatechange #sustainableliving #recycling #ouryouth4theclimate #climateeducation #noethicalconsumptionundercapitalism ",
